# .NET
**/obj
**/bin
**/.vs

# Build output of sound-design/make_sounds.py. The script is seeded, so a full run
# reproduces all 51 WAVs byte for byte; tracking 11 MB of them bought nothing. The sixteen
# that actually ship are committed under website/public/sounds and the kill feed's bundle.
sound-design/*/

# Unity: the editor regenerates all of it, and Library/ alone is tens of megabytes.
**/ui/Library
**/ui/Temp
**/ui/Logs
**/ui/UserSettings
**/ui/Build

# Node (docs)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
docs/openapi.json
docs/src/content/docs/reference/api.md
